    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d132">

                <pb facs="0238" n="132" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg132"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Egan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic">June 1,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wharton informs Mr. Egan that the expectation is entertained of a return to
                    the custody of the courts of the United States of the arms placed on board of
                    the <hi rendition="#italic">Itata</hi> and of the ship herself.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
